# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# MI_sim ignore rules
# 本仓库是纯静态 HTML，没有构建步骤、没有依赖。
# This repo is plain static HTML — no build step, no dependencies.
# 所以这里忽略的都是"本地产物"，不是项目代码。
# Everything ignored below is local noise, never project source.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# 操作系统垃圾文件 / OS junk
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# 编辑器与 IDE / Editors & IDEs
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.sublime-workspace

# Kiro 本地配置（steering / skills / hooks 属于个人工作流，不随仓库分发）
# Kiro local config — personal workflow, intentionally not shipped
.kiro/

# 自动化验证产物：截图与临时预览页，均以下划线开头
# Verification artifacts: screenshots and scratch preview pages (underscore-prefixed)
_*.html
_*.png
_*.txt
*.tmp

# 仿真数据导出（如果以后加了 CSV / NPZ 导出功能）
# Simulation data exports (in case export is added later)
*.csv
*.npz
*.h5
data/
out/

# 日志 / Logs
*.log
logs/

# 归档文件 / Archives
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.7z
